# Store every text file with LF endings and check it out that way too.
#
# Without this, Git on Windows (core.autocrlf=true) converts files to CRLF on
# checkout, while .prettierrc.json sets "endOfLine": "lf" — so a fresh clone
# would fail `npm run format:check` on every single file, for a reason that has
# nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf
